flowchart TD
    Gene["miRNA gene (RNA Pol II)"] --> primiRNA["pri-miRNA<br/>(capped, polyadenylated)"]
    primiRNA --> Drosha["DROSHA/DGCR8<br/>(Nuclear RNase III)<br/>cleaves to ~65 nt hairpin"]
    Drosha --> premiRNA["pre-miRNA hairpin<br/>exported by Exportin-5/RanGTP"]
    premiRNA --> Dicer["DICER/TRBP<br/>(Cytoplasmic RNase III)<br/>cleaves to ~22 bp duplex"]
    Dicer --> Duplex["miRNA:miRNA* duplex"]
    Duplex --> RISC["AGO2/RISC loading<br/>(guide strand retained;<br/>passenger strand* degraded)"]
    RISC --> mRNA["Target mRNA<br/>(3'UTR complementarity)"]
    mRNA -->|"Perfect match<br/>(siRNA-like)"| Cleavage["mRNA CLEAVAGE<br/>(slicer activity of AGO2)"]
    mRNA -->|"Imperfect match<br/>(miRNA typical)"| Repression["Translational repression +<br/>mRNA deadenylation/decay"]

    style RISC fill:#8e44ad,color:#fff
    style Cleavage fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff
    style Repression fill:#e67e22,color:#fff
